      "side": 1,
      "message": "Next iteration on the drawShape() signature, using just StrokeParams. Updated StrokeParams to match the tessellators dynamic stroke struct. The fill/stroke style is pushed into DrawFlags, which I both like and dislike. \n\nIn every use case except for path effects, I thought it made a lot of sense and felt flexible and easy to reason about. For path effects, since it has to go in and out of SkStrokeRec, it got a little clunky.",
      "revId": "ab5232ca59144dd96813d765d4c24ef83fafc35c",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
