      "writtenOn": "2021-10-12T16:34:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could skip these changes and keep StrokeParams as it used to be, but with these changes it exactly matches the instance data used by the tessellator. In most cases we are also really only interested in the half width, but arguments could be made that we shouldn\u0027t compute it yet.",
